  "description": "IVDS is uniquely suited to large volume sampling.Collection from saliva or sputum are straightforward \u2013 collection in disposable pipette and transfer to a small vial, dilute as needed, filter, and test, all at under 5 minutes including results.Sample collection, storage and processing are straightforward, not requiring sensitive or unstable solutions.",
